    "reply": "Bonita Springs noted. And yes—the missing exact plan name stays an open check. What we do know is enough to keep the comparison moving.\n\nSince you want to keep a cardiologist and watch total cost, the next big factor is prescriptions. In Medicare Advantage, drug coverage is often built into the plan, and medicines can change which plans fit well and what your overall costs look like. That still wouldn’t verify coverage by itself, but it helps narrow what to compare.",
    "question": "Which prescriptions should we include? You can list the medicines you want included, or say none for now.",
